item.description:
DHS statistics reveal New York has ignored over 16,000 ICE detainer requests regarding more than 50,000 crimes under Governor Hochul’s administration. Former Senior DHS Advisor and Sentinel CEO Charles Marino breaks down the conflict between local sanctuary policies and federal immigration enforcement, addressing officer-involved shooting incidents, public pushback, and the political implications for ICE funding and oversight if Democrats regain control of Congress in the midterms.Plus, FOX News Chief Congressional Correspondent Chad Pergram joins to analyze how redistricting gains in Texas, Florida, and California, voter reaction to gas prices and the war in Iran, and Senate matchups in states like Iowa, Texas, and Michigan are shaping the fight for control of Congress.

PHOTO CREDIT: AP PHOTO&nbsp;


